yield: 0.17 g (70%) (1S)-1-Pyridin-2-ylethanol (4b) 17. ee 5% (catalyst
A). HPLC: Lux Cellulose-1, hexane-i-PrOH (90:10); flow rate: 1.0 mL/min,
λ = 254 nm; tR (R) = 7.4 min, tR (S) = 7.9 min.
